sequenceDiagram

actor Rep as Approved provider representative
participant Server as server.js
participant Route as routes/provider.js + guards + validation
participant C as controllers/vehicles.js
participant S as services/vehicles.js + providers guard
participant M as Provider / Vehicle / Booking
participant DB as MongoDB
Rep->>Server: POST vehicle or PATCH details, availability, activation
Server->>Route: Match provider workspace path
Route->>Route: Authenticate, authorize provider, require approval, validate
Route->>C: Normalized input and scoped actor
C->>S: createVehicle / updateVehicle / updateAvailability / setVehicleActivation
activate S
S->>DB: Start transaction
S->>M: Increment owned Provider revision, recheck approval
M->>DB: Provider guard and current state in session
alt Create
    S->>M: Construct Vehicle with actor.providerId
else Existing vehicle
    S->>M: Guard Vehicle scoped to actor.providerId
    M->>DB: Increment vehicle revision
end
opt Offering period update
    S->>M: Check confirmed bookings due today or later
    M->>DB: Reject a window excluding an upcoming/ongoing booking
end
S->>M: Apply allowlisted changes and save
M->>DB: Save vehicle with same session
DB-->>S: Commit
S-->>C: Vehicle
deactivate S
C->>C: serializeVehicle
C-->>Server: 201 create or 200 update
Server-->>Rep: JSON response
Note over S,DB: Errors abort, duplicate VIN and eligible write conflicts map to 409, missing owned vehicle is 404
